### Create credit application
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "creditAmount": 300000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "income": 100000,
  "currentCreditLoad": 20000,
  "creditRating": 700
}

### Get application status (replace {id} with the id returned from the previous request)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/applications/{id}/status
